  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gansu Revitalization and Innovation Project (GRIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall, the project is to increase opportunities for culture-based sustainable economic development in Gansu, by integrating the safeguarding of traditional heritage and culture with the development of CCIs, under an integrated identity-building and capacity-building around the Silk Road narrative. The project will address the gaps identified building on the &apos;City, Culture and Creativity Framework&apos; elaborated jointly with the World Bank to support decision-makers to address urban development challenges and local socio-economic development issues by leveraging culture, creativity and CCIs in an integrated manner.</narrative>
  </description>
